 "remarks": "Some homes are built. This one is crafted - and it can be yours. AR Luxury Homes presents a Bespoke Colonial set on 5.35 level, serene acres in Greenwich, with interiors by Tara Benet Design. Walls of glass flood the home with natural light while soaring ceilings and an elevator define the scale and flow of open living spaces thoughtfully designed for the way you actually live. An expansive primary suite, dedicated wellness center, golf simulator and media room speak to a standard of living rarely offered at this level. Beyond the walls, a heated pool and spa, tennis court, outdoor kitchen, heated terrace with Ghost Screens and fireplace, and a private one-bedroom guest house complete a compound where every finish, every detail, and every square foot is still yours to shape. This is not just a home. It is a legacy - being built for you.",
